msgid "Counting your training volume"
msgstr ""

#: src/features/legal/texts/HowPowrDecides.tsx
msgid "Daily weigh-ins vary with water and food, so POWR shows a smoothed trend and a weekly rate, and compares it with ranges research considers sensible for your goal."
